.amLbls, chk AmendWitness.tdσ AmendWitness.tdLbls]\n#eval [chk NonRegression.lvσ NonRegression.lvLbls, chk Witness.gtσ Witness.gtLbls,\n  chk Witness.rxbσ Witness.rxbLbls, chk CapacityWitness.frσ CapacityWitness.frLbls,\n  chk CapacityWitness.exσ CapacityWitness.exLbls, chk CapacityWitness.tmσ CapacityWitness.tmLbls,\n  chk abσ abLbls, chk Witness.giσ Witness.giLbls, chk Witness.rxaσ Witness.rxaLbls]\nEOF\ntime ~/.elan/bin/lake env lean $SP/PS.lean 2>&1 | head -20","description":"Sweep ProtectedOK over all traces","timeout":1200000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
